---
import NotesLayout from '@/layouts/NotesLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/site.config';
import { ui } from '@/i18n/ui';
---

<NotesLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Joe Cheung, CAE and HPC engineer"
  banner="index"
  bannerTitleEn="About"
  bannerTitleZh="关于"
  bannerSubtitleEn="Joe Cheung · CAE and HPC engineer"
  bannerSubtitleZh="Joe Cheung · 计算力学与高性能计算工程师"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="prose-custom">
      <p class="i18n-en text-lg text-notion-text dark:text-notion-text-dark/80">
        I am a CAE R&D engineer working on computational fluid dynamics, rigid-body
        dynamics, and discrete element methods. That work is industrial
        computational mechanics on GPU: solvers that have to be correct, fast, and
        shippable.
      </p>
      <p class="i18n-zh text-lg text-notion-text dark:text-notion-text-dark/80">
        我是做 CFD、刚体动力学与离散元方法的 CAE 研发工程师。这是工业计算力学的 GPU 实现：求解器要正确、要快、要能交付。
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span class="i18n-en">What I work on</span>
        <span class="i18n-zh">在做什么</span>
      </h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="i18n-en"><strong>Particle solvers</strong> — SPH, DEM, and rigid-body contact for industrial cases.</span>
          <span class="i18n-zh"><strong>粒子求解器</strong> — SPH、DEM 与刚体接触，面向工业工况。</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="i18n-en"><strong>GPU computing</strong> — CUDA C++, kernel design, and solver-scale data movement.</span>
          <span class="i18n-zh"><strong>GPU 计算</strong> — CUDA C++、核函数设计与求解器规模的数据搬运。</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="i18n-en"><strong>HPC plumbing</strong> — MPI runtime dispatch, CMake packages, offline CUDA builder images.</span>
          <span class="i18n-zh"><strong>HPC 基础设施</strong> — MPI 运行时分发、CMake 包、离线 CUDA 构建镜像。</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>
        <span class="i18n-en">Public vs private</span>
        <span class="i18n-zh">公开与私有</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="i18n-en">
        Production solvers and client studies stay private. The public repos are the
        reusable pieces around them: viewers, expression runtimes, MPI dispatch, and
        GPU build tooling.
      </p>
      <p class="i18n-zh">
        生产求解器与客户算例保持私有。公开仓库是周边可复用件：后处理查看器、表达式运行时、MPI 分发层、GPU 构建工具。
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span class="i18n-en">Stack</span>
        <span class="i18n-zh">技术栈</span>
      </h2>
      <p>C++17/20 · CUDA · SPH · DEM · CMake · MPI · Python</p>

      <h2>
        <span class="i18n-en">This site</span>
        <span class="i18n-zh">本站</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="i18n-en">
        Personal landing plus a small notes archive on algorithms, modern C++, CMake,
        and CUDA. Built with Astro, Tailwind, MDX, and MiniSearch.
      </p>
      <p class="i18n-zh">
        个人主页，附带算法、现代 C++、CMake 与 CUDA 笔记。用 Astro、Tailwind、MDX 和 MiniSearch 搭建。
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span class="i18n-en">Contact</span>
        <span class="i18n-zh">联系</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="i18n-en">
        Open to CAE, HPC, and GPU solver work.
      </p>
      <p class="i18n-zh">
        计算力学、高性能计算与 GPU 求解器方向都可以合作。
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="i18n-en">{ui.en.email}: </span>
          <span class="i18n-zh">{ui.zh.email}: </span>
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>
        </li>
        <li>GitHub: <a href={siteConfig.social.github}>{siteConfig.social.github}</a></li>
        <li>X: <a href={siteConfig.social.x}>@JoeCheungZzz</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</NotesLayout>
